<h1>Contact and self-service support</h1><p>For security, privacy, legal or important service matters: <a href="mailto:contact.stay@funtoolie.com">contact.stay@funtoolie.com</a>. Delivery and monitoring must be verified before launch. No message is sent automatically by this application.</p>
<p>Use <a href="/Install">installation help</a> and <a href="/Limitations">availability limitations</a> first. Signed-in owners can <a href="/Owner/Feedback">send product feedback</a> or <a href="/Owner/Feedback?kind=Custom">Custom requirements</a>. These are saved privately; no guaranteed reply, implementation date or entitlement follows.</p><p>Routine individual support, onboarding, phone/live chat and bespoke changes are not included. Mandatory rights and privacy/security obligations remain. Guests should contact their accommodation property directly about requests, terms or cancellation.</p>
